# Cloudflare only

This app is hosted on Cloudflare and is used only there. Do not run it locally.

- Do not start `npm run dev`, `wrangler dev`, or any local server.
- Do not apply D1 migrations with `--local`, and do not use a local D1 database.
- Schema changes go to production with `npx wrangler d1 migrations apply freelancer-invoices --remote`, then `npm run deploy`.
- Verify behavior against the deployed Cloudflare app, not `http://127.0.0.1:8787`.
